 "_about": "Vendor aliases for scripts/gmail_match.py. Edit freely. merchants are case-insensitive, whitespace-collapsed substrings of the ledger merchant. senders are domains (match the From domain and its parents) or full addresses. entity is informational only (which company the vendor addresses its receipts to, still undecided for Firecrawl and Oderland, see docs/kvittolaget.html); the address to forward from comes from the worklist via --entity, never from here. Bare words like kvitto or receipt do not belong in subject_terms: they pull other vendors' receipts onto the row. Never add card digits here.",
